Package: alleleclustergenotype
Title: B/TCR Allele Clusters Inference and Genotype
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(person("Ayelet", "Peres", role=c("aut","cre"), 
                    email="peresay@biu.ac.il"),
            person("William", "Lees", role=c("aut"), 
                    email="william@lees.org.uk"),
             person("Gur", "Yaari", role=c("aut","cph"), 
                    email="gur.yaari@biu.ac.il"))
Description: The package provides two tools. The first is Allele Clusters, this tool is designed to reduce the ambiguity within the IGHV alleles. 
             The ambiguity is caused by duplicated or similar alleles which are shared among different genes. 
             The second tool is an allele based genotype, that determined the presence of an allele based on a threshold derived from a naive population.
